.SH NAME
.PP
removeStp \- remove STP service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]oma.removeStp()\f[]
.SH CATEGORY
.PP
Oma
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
This function is used to remove STP service(Sequence Time Protocol service) from
target host of sdbcm.
.SH PARAMETERS
.PP
None
.SH RETURN VALUE
.PP
When the function executes successfully, there is no return value.
.PP
When the function fails, an exception will be thrown and an error message will
be printed.
